BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Gemini AI//Baden-Wuerttemberg Holidays and Bridge Days 2026//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Holidays & Bridge Days BW 2026
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Berlin
COMMENT:PROMPT USED: Create an iCalendar (.ics) file for all public holidays in 
 the German state of Baden-Wuerttemberg for the year 2026. For each event\, fo
 llow these strict formatting rules: 1. Summary: Include the English name\, th
 en a forward slash\, then the German name\, followed by the URL to the German
  Wikipedia page for that holiday in parentheses. 2. Description: Use the for
 mat 'Feiertag [German Holiday Name]'. 3. Bridge Days: Identify and add 'Brued
 kentage' (Bridge Days) for any Monday or Friday that sits between a weekend a
 nd a public holiday. Use 'Brueckentag' as the Summary and 'Brueckentag ([Desc
 ription of the day])' as the Description. 4. Technical: Ensure all events are
  'All Day' events (DTSTART;VALUE=DATE) and use the Europe/Berlin timezone.

